  "_comment": "DJI Matrice 350 RTK. Same airframe as the M300 but a different pack: Li-ion TB65 (263.2 Wh) against the M300's LiPo TB60 (274 Wh), at 6.47 kg instead of 6.3. DJI claims 55 min for both, so the pair is an A/B test of whether the model has the right SENSITIVITY, not just the right absolute answer.\n\nValidated in FORWARD FLIGHT, not hover: DJI measures the M350's 55 min at about 8 m/s without payload. That makes this the only multicopter example here that checks the translational side of the model.",
